<main><section class="stage"><div class="scene-title">MARISA / FEEDING STUDY 01</div><div id="speech" class="speech">给魔理沙添一盆油粮吧。</div><canvas id="view" aria-label="魔理沙与食盆的三维进食场景"></canvas><div id="error" role="alert"></div><div class="camera"><button data-view="three">三分之四</button><button data-view="front">正面</button><button data-view="side">侧面</button><button id="orbit">环视</button></div><div class="hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放</div></section>
<aside><section class="card"><div class="eyebrow">FOOD BOWL</div><h2>一盆油粮</h2><div class="row"><span>盆内余粮</span><span id="food" class="value">0 / 8 份</span></div><div class="bar gold"><span id="foodbar"></span></div><div class="actions"><button id="fill" class="primary">装满油粮</button><button id="eat">让魔理沙进食</button><button id="empty" class="secondary">清空食盆</button></div><p class="note">每取一口减少一份，吞咽后增加饱腹度。空盆会停止进食，可继续添粮。</p></section>
<section class="card"><div class="eyebrow">MARISA</div><h2>慢慢吃，真幸福</h2><div id="status" class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">等待添粮</div><div class="row"><span>饱腹度</span><span id="fullness" class="value">0%</span></div><div class="bar"><span id="fullbar"></span></div><div class="transport"><button id="pause">暂停</button><button id="reset">重新开始</button></div><label class="speed">速度<input id="speed" type="range" min=".25" max="1.5" step=".25" value="1"><span id="speedvalue">1×</span></label><p class="note">装粮后自动走近食盆。吃饱后停下休息。</p></section>
